<div class="callout callout--red">
  <span class="label label--red">Standing reminder</span>
  The Department watches, gathers, records and refers. It never arrests, searches or seizes, and never answers a question of meaning. Anything that turns on what the Doctrine means is written down and sent up to the Advocate untouched.
</div>

